       This program is part of NNeettppbbmm(1).

       yyuuvvsspplliittttooppppmm  reads three files, containing the YUV components, as in‐
       put.  These files are _b_a_s_e_n_a_m_e.Y, _b_a_s_e_n_a_m_e.U, and _b_a_s_e_n_a_m_e.V.  Produces
       a PPM image on Standard Output.

       Since the YUV files are raw files, the dimensions _w_i_d_t_h and _h_e_i_g_h_t must
       be specified on the command line.


OOPPTTIIOONNSS
       In addition to the options common to all programs  based  on  libnetpbm
       (most notably --qquuiieett, see
        Common  Options ⟨index.html#commonoptions⟩ ), yyuuvvsspplliittttooppppmm recognizes
       the following command line option:



       --cccciirr660011
